# Not built.  xd loads and saves Xdelta version archives: it needs
# libxdelta 1.x (xdelta.h), which is long unmaintained and not packaged
# for MSYS2 or current Linux distributions, and it builds its thumbnails
# with libXpm (X11/xpm.h) and runs child processes with fork/waitpid.
# Porting it means reimplementing the archive format; until someone does,
# the plug-in is left out on every platform.
